n", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17362, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01N29wvhv4yPgRXqKwdtMSfm", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release healthy in production (v2.3.1 unhealthy in production; v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy). (2) Rolled back to v2.3.0. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial failure, leaving the service mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions: us-east, us-west, and eu-west are on v2.3.0. Current status: healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 health check failures and the orchestrator partial failure during the first rollback attempt; no v2.3.1 redeploy until root cause is understood."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47962, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N29wvhv4yPgRXqKwdtMSfm", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47962, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N29wvhv4yPgRXqKwdtMSfm", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49023, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LibGJyzBbC3EmfYsumiNRp", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49323, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LibGJyzBbC3EmfYsumiNRp", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_